    <div id="container-f6ba592e04" class="cmp-container container-preview">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="title h6 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
  <div id="title-83b2b67630" class="cmp-title">
 <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Asset management and investment</h3>
</div>

    
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">
<div id="text-2875b594e1" class="cmp-text">
    <p>In the asset management and investment industry, gaining insight that provides a competitive advantage is key, particularly in today’s interconnected, fast-paced global environment, where quickly identifying investment opportunities and risks can be the difference between success and failure.</p>
<p>Whether assessing investment and portfolio risk, implementing quantitative trading strategies, or managing regulatory needs, access to quality third-party data and sophisticated analytical tools, can help provide an edge.</p>
<p>Moody’s can help asset managers and investment professionals by providing:</p>
<ul><li><p>Globally standardized financial information for over 190 million companies<br />
<br />
</p>
</li><li><p>Over 630 million financial ratings and scores<br />
<br />
</p>
</li><li><p>Near-zero latency news and alerts</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="button btn-quick-link aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">




<a id="button-b6dc16d4e9" class="cmp-button " data-linktype="link" href="https://www.moodys.com/web/en/us/capabilities/company-reference-data/data-use-cases/data-for-asset-management.html" target="_blank">
    
    

    <span class="cmp-button__text ">More on asset management and investment</span>
</a>

</div>

    
</div>

        <div class="center-align">
            
        </div>
    </div>

    

</div>

    
</div>

        <div class="center-align">
            
        </div>
    </div>

    

</div>

        </div>
        
    </div>
<div class="tabs-content-wrapper">
        
