    <div id="container-3fb536bd28" class="cmp-container container-preview">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="container responsivegrid aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    
    <div id="container-9d01451bff" class="cmp-container container-preview">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="title h6 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
  <div id="title-73ebe7c6aa" class="cmp-title">
 <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Patent research and analysis</h3>
</div>

    
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div id="text-ea84bd8f05" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Intellectual property is a key differentiator and companies use patents to increase market share, to protect the business, and to enter into joint partnerships to reduce costs and increase go-to-market speed.</p>
<p>Government agencies need patent data to monitor strategic assets, understand industry trends, and track intangible asset valuations. Both public and private sector entities need rich, granular data to help perform competitive benchmarking, link patents to their entities and owners, understand trends in the short-term, and scan the technology horizon for a longer-term view.</p>
<p>Moody’s can help you with your patent research and analysis needs by providing:</p>
<ul><li><p>Over 25 years of deal data, including 3 million deals and rumors<br />
<br />
</p>
</li><li><p>Over 2.4 million entities with IP data and over 186 million patents</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="button btn-quick-link aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">




<a id="button-af16004577" class="cmp-button " data-linktype="link" href="/web/en/us/capabilities/company-reference-data/data-use-cases/data-for-patent-research.html">
    
    

    <span class="cmp-button__text ">More on patent research and analysis</span>
</a>

</div>

    
</div>

        <div class="center-align">
            
        </div>
    </div>

    

</div>

    
</div>

        <div class="center-align">
            
        </div>
    </div>

    

</div>

        </div>
        
    </div>
<div class="tabs-content-wrapper">
        
        <!-- mobile header -->
        <div class="tabs-tab tabs-tab-m">
            <span class="tabs-tab-number">06</span>
            
            <span class="tabs-tab-text">Research and competitive intelligence</span>
        </div>
        <div id="tabs-e9dfcb3ea0-item-3aed53e743-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabs-e9dfcb3ea0-item-3aed53e743-tab" tabindex="-1" class="cmp-tabs__tabpanel" data-cmp-hook-tabs="tabpanel" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;tabs-e9dfcb3ea0-item-3aed53e743&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/tabs/v1/tabs/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Research and competitive intelligence&#34;}}">
            <!-- check -->
