<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="container responsivegrid aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    
    <div id="container-a6101d0375" class="cmp-container container-preview">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="title h6 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
  <div id="title-6ab5484c82" class="cmp-title">
 <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Supplier due diligence</h3>
</div>

    
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div id="text-b8ffaf5f07" class="cmp-text">
    <p>As supply chains grow more complex, so do the risks they bring. From credit and compliance to fair trade and environmental, emerging risks in supply chains need to be monitored and managed before they have a business impact. Whether reviewing potential and existing suppliers for operational, reputational, environmental, or other business risks, timely, granular data is needed to help facilitate supplier risk assessment.</p>
<p>Moody&#39;s can help you build a 360° view of your suppliers by providing:</p>
<ul><li><p>Data on over 635 million global entities<br />
<br />
</p>
</li><li><p>Sustainability scores for over 340 million companies globally<br />
<br />
</p>
</li><li><p>Access to over 2 billion ownership links, including over 200 million active links</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="button btn-quick-link aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">




<a id="button-b9b350896e" class="cmp-button " data-linktype="link" href="https://www.moodys.com/web/en/us/supplier-risk.html" target="_blank">
    
    

    <span class="cmp-button__text ">More on supplier risk management</span>
</a>

</div>

    
</div>

        <div class="center-align">
            
        </div>
    </div>

    

</div>

    
</div>

        <div class="center-align">
            
        </div>
    </div>

    

</div>

        </div>
        
    </div>
<div class="tabs-content-wrapper">
        
        <!-- mobile header -->
        <div class="tabs-tab tabs-tab-m">
            <span class="tabs-tab-number">09</span>
            
            <span class="tabs-tab-text">Tax and transfer pricing</span>
        </div>
        <div id="tabs-e9dfcb3ea0-item-b1542f1136-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabs-e9dfcb3ea0-item-b1542f1136-tab" tabindex="-1" class="cmp-tabs__tabpanel" data-cmp-hook-tabs="tabpanel" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;tabs-e9dfcb3ea0-item-b1542f1136&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/tabs/v1/tabs/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Tax and transfer pricing&#34;}}">
