<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="title h6 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
  <div id="title-5238dbfd93" class="cmp-title">
 <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Trade credit</h3>
</div>

    
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div id="text-86b74c2e96" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Trade credit fosters collaboration between businesses to make efficient use of short-term capital to accomplish various shared objectives, allowing for the growth of businesses and the establishment of long-term customer relationships.</p>
<p>Challenges can arise when it is necessary to quickly assess risks during the customer onboarding process and effectively monitor changes to existing customer risk profiles.</p>
<p>Moody’s can help address trade credit needs with:</p>
<ul><li><p>Behavioral data, including detailed spending and AP data in many supply chain categories<br />
<br />
</p>
</li><li><p>Credit monitoring alerts on bankruptcies, liens, and other actions<br />
<br />
</p>
</li><li><p>Firmographic data that includes information from millions of entities worldwide</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="button btn-quick-link aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">




<a id="button-8c3afb4d67" class="cmp-button " data-linktype="link" href="https://www.moodys.com/web/en/us/who-we-serve/corporations/trade-credit.html">
    
    

    <span class="cmp-button__text ">More on trade credit</span>
</a>

