            </div>
            <h5 data-tracking-label="Moody’s wins five categories in Chartis Financial Crime and Compliance50, 2025">Moody’s wins five categories in Chartis Financial Crime and Compliance50, 2025 </h5>
            <p>On February 27, 2025, Chartis Research published its second Financial Crime and Compliance (FCC50) ranking and report. The FCC50 report evaluated nearly 300 vendors across core financial crime disciplines and identified 50 leaders in financial crime and compliance.</p>

            <div class="category-list">
                
