    <span class="icon-small icon-article"></span><span>article</span>
</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-metadata">
                
                
                
                <span class="card-attribution">
                    Moody&#39;s
                </span>
            </div>
            <h5 data-tracking-label="Increase confidence in your investment decisions with third-party data">Increase confidence in your investment decisions with third-party data </h5>
            <p>What has helped Asset Managers and Investment Professionals stay on top of market movements and global shifts is the implementation of a robust risk management process, from the front office to the back, to provide a 360° view of investment and portfolio risk.</p>

            <div class="category-list">
                
            </div>
            <div class="card-body-bottom">
                
                <a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-quick-link" data-tracking-id="Read more" href="https://www.moodysanalytics.com/articles/2022/increase-confidence-in-your-investment-decisions-with-third-party-data" target="_blank">Read more</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


</div>
<div class="card-insight aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    
    <div class="insight  variation-article">
        
        <div class="card-header">
            <div class="card-insight-image-wrapper">
                
    
    
        
            
                <div data-linktarget="_self" data-classname="img-cover card-insight-image" class="responsive-image" data-wcmdisabled data-mode="smartcrop" data-contenturl="https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/content/" data-videoserver="https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/content/" data-imageserver="https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/image/" data-viewer-path="https://s7d1.scene7.com/s7viewers/" data-asset-type="image" data-asset-name="the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting.jpg" data-asset-path="moodyscorp/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting-1">
                        <picture>
                            
                                
                                    <source media="(min-width: 1200px)" srcset="https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/image/moodyscorp/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting-1?$responsive$ 2x, https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/image/moodyscorp/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting-1?$responsive$ 1x"/> 
                                
                                    <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/image/moodyscorp/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting-1?$responsive$ 2x, https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/image/moodyscorp/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting-1?$responsive$ 1x"/> 
                                
                                    <source media="(min-width: 375px)" srcset="https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/image/moodyscorp/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting-1?$responsive$ 2x, https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/image/moodyscorp/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting-1?$responsive$&wid=400&fit=constrain,1 1x"/> 
                                
                                <img itemprop="contentUrl" src="https://s7d1.scene7.com/is/image/moodyscorp/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting-1?$responsive$" class="img-cover card-insight-image" alt loading="lazy" role="presentation"/>
                            
                            
                        </picture>
                </div>
            
            
        
    

            </div>
            
            
    

            <div class="card-insight-variation">
    
    
    
        
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    

    <span class="icon-small icon-article"></span><span>article</span>
</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <div class="card-metadata">
                
                
                
                <span class="card-attribution">
                    Moody&#39;s
                </span>
            </div>
            <h5 data-tracking-label="The importance of third-party data in effective bank underwriting">The importance of third-party data in effective bank underwriting </h5>
            <p>As we move from an era of central banks injecting liquidity into the financial system to one of monetary tightening, the time of “easy money” is quickly giving way to global inflationary pressures and rapidly rising interest rates.</p>

            <div class="category-list">
                
            </div>
            <div class="card-body-bottom">
                
                <a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-quick-link" data-tracking-id="Read more" href="https://www.moodysanalytics.com/articles/2022/the-importance-of-third-party-data-in-effective-bank-underwriting" target="_blank">Read more</a>
